id: primal-rage
name: Primal Rage
talentCategory: racial
race: saiyan
prerequisites: Saiyan, 2+ Raging Talents
description: >
  Your unrelenting ire burns deep within the depths of your soul, igniting in a fiery blaze of fury when you’ve been hurt.
text: >
  Primal Rage: Your unrelenting ire burns deep within the depths of your soul, igniting in a fiery blaze of fury when you’ve been hurt.
  –Prerequisites: Saiyan, 2+ Raging Talents
  (1)-[Passive]: While in the Raging State, increase your Tier of Power Extra Dice by 1 Dice Category.
  (2)-[Triggered/Raging, 1/Encounter]: If you are below the Bruised Health Threshold, gain a stack of Battle Born.

---

[passive]
# (1) Under the ceiling every Dice Category raise is held to.
if (inState("raging")) {
    dice.extra.category += 1;
}

# (2) Entering the Raging State below the Bruised Health Threshold (Bruised or worse): a stack of Battle Born, put where you say.
# Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/state/raging, 1/encounter, effect 2]
requires belowThreshold("bruised");
gainOneOf(battlebornstrike, battleborndodge, battlebornwound);
